text:
 {
  "turns": [
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "Thank you for calling Nimbus Telecom. My name is Vikram. How can I help you today?",
      "tags": [
        "greeting"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "Hi Vikram, I am so frustrated. My phone has been dropping calls every five minutes and I can't get any work done. This is ridiculous!",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "I am very sorry to hear that you're experiencing these drops, I know how disruptive that is when you're trying to work.",
      "tags": [
        "empathy"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "Before we look into the device settings, could you please provide me with your account number?",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "Yes, it is 83587246. My name is Fatima Brown.",
      "tags": [
        "identity_verification"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "Thank you, Ms. Brown. I see your account here. Let's try a quick network reset on your device to see if that stabilizes the connection.",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "I've already tried restarting it twice, but it's still happening. I'm using the phone number 94160 47660.",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "I appreciate you trying that. Since the basic reset didn't work, it sounds like there might be a hardware issue with the SIM card or the device antenna.",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "I just want this fixed. I can't keep losing calls with my clients.",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "I understand. I will book a device check for you at our nearest service center so a technician can run a full diagnostic on the hardware.",
      "tags": [
        "action:device_fix"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "Oh, that sounds like a plan. I can definitely do that tomorrow morning. Thank you for actually doing something about this.",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "You're very welcome. Is there anything else I can assist you with today? To recap, we have booked your device check for tomorrow. Have a great day!",
      "tags": [
        "closure"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
